        a="Teams often arrives as part of Microsoft 365 and gets used without anyone planning it. The result is duplicate teams, files scattered across chats and guests with more access than intended. A short set-up session fixes the structure, the guest rules and the audio devices, which is where most day-to-day complaints come from.",
