        a="A firewall installed years ago and never touched since is a common finding. Its firmware is out of date, its subscription has lapsed and its rules include openings nobody remembers asking for. Firewall support brings it up to date, reviews each rule with the business and keeps a record so future changes are deliberate.",
        x="Firewall subscriptions for filtering and threat updates often renew automatically and quietly lapse when a card expires. We note renewal dates in the support record.",
